 hosted call recording, and business internet access products; converged networking, communications, and security solutions; and wireless, fibre, satellite, and LTE connectivity solutions, as well as consulting services, digital solutions, managed services, and cloud services. Its Applied Electronics segment provides search and tracking radar systems; radar sensor systems; ground and naval search and tracking radar systems; communication systems; cryptographic products and solutions; electronic components and printed circuit boards; remote controlled stabilized weapons platforms; and energy engineering and storage solutions. This segment also offers military and commercial products, including technology solutions; and electronic manufacturing services. It serves municipalities, parastatals, utilities, the mining and building industries, corporate and retail customers, small to medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), government, and state-owned entities, and defense forces. Reunert Limited was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Sandton, South Africa.","employees":null,"website":"https://reunert.com","country":"South Africa","city":"Sandton","officers":[{"name":"Mr. K. Mark Kathan AMP (Harward), C.A., CA (SA)","title":"Group CFO & Executive Director"},{"name":"Ms. Mohini  Moodley BA, LLB","title":"Group Human Capital & Sustainability Executive Director and Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Graeme Wales Eddey","title":"Segment Chief Executive Officer of Electrical Engineering"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":6.886,"tpe":9.225,"ps":0.5517,"pfcf":10.39,"peg":null,"pb":79.6,"rev_growth":0.029,"eps_growth":0.024,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1154,"eps_growth_next":0.1063,"div_yield":0.03555,"roe":0.1078,"roa":0.05468,"de":51.89,"gross_margin":0.2229,"op_margin":0.07537,"profit_margin":0.05224,"current_ratio":1.54},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":6.886,"sector":6.886,"pct":64,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":9.225,"sector":9.225,"pct":60,"verdict"